/-!
# The nonterminals and parameters of ECMA-262's grammars

Generated by `crates/jsgrammar` from spec.html (`scripts/jsgrammar.py --write`;
docs/parser/GRAMMAR.md). Do not edit.
-/

namespace Ecma.Grammar

/-- The grammar parameters (§5.1.6), numbered by spec/formal/param-ids.txt (`ParamId` is the constructor
index): each keeps its number and a new one takes the next, in the order spec.html first declares
them; one the grammar no longer has stays, as `retired_Name`. -/
inductive Param where
  | Sep
  | Yield
  | Await
  | In
  | Tagged
  | Return
  | Default
  | Pattern
  | Using
  | Extended
  | UnicodeMode
  | UnicodeSetsMode
  | NamedCaptureGroups
  deriving BEq, Inhabited

